However, Shirou's movements didn't stop there;
once he had finished emptying his load,
he started pumping his hips back and forth again.

To the men, however, her circumstances didn't matter in the slightest;
if they couldn't get the pleasure they wanted,
they would simply force it out of her.

She no longer showed any sign of glaring back defiantly;
her mind was completely filled with dread
over what was about to be done to her.

When the insect shook its body--or rather, the hybrid's arm--
from side to side,
the bone creaked and sent a different kind of pain shooting through her.

Of course, the same went for the men who hadn't ordered yet;
they stared with heated, lewd gazes at Ageha
as she panted and kneaded her chest.
